    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n813" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρ-αυλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρός, αὐλή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwelling in the field</i>, of shepherds, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.162
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.317
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Megasth.
				40
			</span></i>; epith. of Pan, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.179
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἀνήρ</span>
			<i>a boor</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				11.60
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			oxen, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὸς ἀγραύλοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.155
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.253
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρ</span>”
