					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					349
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1188
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of
			things, <i>rustic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					342
				</span></i>
			.</div>
